{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"1458","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"輔導產業低碳化 首年預算七億","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">2023/04/04 05:30</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.ctspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E5%B7%A5%E6%A5%AD%E5%B1%80%E8%A3%9C%E5%8A%A9.jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 80%;\\\" /></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">經濟部工業局預計首年編列約七億元，透過法人輔導產業製程低碳化。（資料照）</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; border-radius: 0px; height: 1px; margin: 20px 0px; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\\\" />\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">〔記者林菁樺／台北報導〕疫後條例通過後，經濟部工業局分配一一○億元用於輔導、補助與人才培育三大面向，其中輔導產業包括低碳化與數位化，預計首年編列約七億元，透過法人輔導產業製程低碳化；官員表示，待相關辦法對外公告後，最快四月上路，業者就能獲得補助，進行碳盤查工作。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-weight: 700;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">最快本月上路 補助業者碳盤查</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">台灣去年扣件外銷金額年增二十％，雖是十大出口國中成長率最高的國家，但去年下半年也是因通膨等黑天鵝干擾，訂單已明顯趨緩；螺絲大廠春雨形容，最差的狀況就是去年底，目前正逐步回穩，但買氣還沒到很暢旺。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">金工中心表示，二○二三年台灣扣件產業挑戰包括利率上升、通膨持續等全球經濟面臨諸多不確定性，此外，地緣政治、多邊貿易與美中歐貿易及科技戰等持續，國內外因應氣候變遷、淨零趨勢，還有CBAM開徵、國內氣候變遷因應法都將上路。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">根據疫後條例預算分配，工業局爭取二○二三年到二○二五年共約一一○億元，其中約二十一．一三億元用於產業輔導轉型，約八十四．一三億元是補助產業升級創新平台輔導計畫、傳產業技術開發計畫等，最後約三．八八億元用在人才培育。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">官員指出，產業輔導轉型包括碳盤查相關工作，部分將補助法人等單位，廠商也自籌負擔一部分，詳細執行辦法正在最後討論，最快本月就能公告實施，協助業者能盡快展開碳盤查相關工作，估計首年約有七億元的預算可執行。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\">資料來源:&nbsp;</span><a href=\\\"https://ec.ltn.com.tw/article/paper/1575618\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(197, 224, 180); text-decoration-line: none; outline: 0px !important;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">https://ec.ltn.com.tw/article/paper/1575618</span></a></span></p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2023-04-12","clk_count":"18"}},"__N_SSG":true}